# Prompt #71: prevent browsers/proxies from serving a stale build of the app shell or
# scripts after a deploy. HTML and JS drive auth/session gating and API contracts —
# a cached pre-deploy copy can silently reintroduce fixed bugs (e.g. an old
# avatarApiBase truthiness check, or a stale click handler) until the user hard-reloads.
# Assets are not fingerprinted in this build, so we always revalidate instead of
# relying on cache-busting filenames.
# Prompt #6: also revalidate shared card CSS — phones were keeping pre-MetaGrid
# lantern-cards.css and collapsing the canonical 3-row overlay.

/*.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/js/*.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/css/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
